            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Town</strong> is a top-down shooter focused on fast-paced combat, character progression, and fully destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a variety of maps, earn experience, level up your character, and unlock new weapons, perks, and power-ups to customize your playstyle. Before each battle, choose up to four active perks and prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different game modes, each offering a unique objective and gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: Complete 20 maps by collecting the required number of points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong>: Face powerful bosses across 15 dedicated maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Stay alive for as long as possible, earn points, and beat your highest score.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 weapons to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression with experience and skill points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable perks and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 active perks at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with different shapes and color patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is destructible.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Town</strong> is a top-down shooter focused on fast-paced combat, character progression, and fully destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a variety of maps, earn experience, level up your character, and unlock new weapons, perks, and power-ups to customize your playstyle. Before each battle, choose up to four active perks and prepare for the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different game modes, each offering a unique objective and gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: Complete 20 maps by collecting the required number of points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong>: Face powerful bosses across 15 dedicated maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong>: Stay alive for as long as possible, earn points, and beat your highest score.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 weapons to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression with experience and skill points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable perks and power-ups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 active perks at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization with different shapes and color patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is destructible.</strong></p>",
